{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n日本MUJI官網上架全新「全鋁合金硬殼行李箱」，擺脫以往常見的PC聚碳酸酯材質，換上一身充滿科技感的金屬銀，一登場便掀起熱話，被廣大網民直呼為「平價版 Rimowa」，日本官網已經斷貨了！行李箱採用堅固耐用的全鋁合金框架結構，性能細節同樣誠意滿滿：配備極致滑順的雙輪靜音滾輪、符合人體工學的3段式調節拉桿，以及密碼鎖兼TSA海關安全鎖孔。（MUJI之前行李箱都是鑰匙版本，一大進步）目前日本已率先推出快閃必備的 34L 登機尺寸（售價79,000日圓，約HK$3,928），另備有 60L 容量可選。\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179362118991033549_15533058266ae87cc62b194.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179362118991033549_15533058266ae87cc62b194.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179362119204176420_17567464286ae87cc835ffb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179362119204176420_17567464286ae87cc835ffb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179362119363525045_7346037176ae87cc9c9ddf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179362119363525045_7346037176ae87cc9c9ddf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17936211951997973_17434744446ae87ccb55167.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17936211951997973_17434744446ae87ccb55167.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/